    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/bfb621d3e907cf02c256ba01c3ae0b6d.poster.avif?t=1754675953\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/bfb621d3e907cf02c256ba01c3ae0b6d.webm?t=1754675953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/bfb621d3e907cf02c256ba01c3ae0b6d.mp4?t=1754675953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nylos is a <strong> puzzle </strong>platformer that takes players through diverse environments\u2013from lush caves to floating islands and high-tech labs.<br><br>The game introduces a <strong>variety</strong> <strong>of unique powers</strong> that you can <strong>combine</strong> in creative ways to solve puzzles and explore every corner of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/ba40a224f4653aa300793ad435c24a46.poster.avif?t=1754675953\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/ba40a224f4653aa300793ad435c24a46.webm?t=1754675953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/ba40a224f4653aa300793ad435c24a46.mp4?t=1754675953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nylos</strong>, a test subject in Dr. Solomon\u2019s AI lab, embarks on a journey to prove himself \u2014 joined by his quirky companion, <strong>Tiko</strong>, who helps, jokes, and keeps things lively as they uncover the lab\u2019s hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/6cc19caea76491533c1bea1b58984fd1.poster.avif?t=1754675953\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/6cc19caea76491533c1bea1b58984fd1.webm?t=1754675953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/6cc19caea76491533c1bea1b58984fd1.mp4?t=1754675953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level offers <strong>multiple ways to solve puzzles</strong>, encouraging players to experiment and find <strong>creative and personal paths</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/6b9e5e383b9f28c38e3c03b074c39b76.poster.avif?t=1754675953\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/6b9e5e383b9f28c38e3c03b074c39b76.webm?t=1754675953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/6b9e5e383b9f28c38e3c03b074c39b76.mp4?t=1754675953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/bfb621d3e907cf02c256ba01c3ae0b6d.poster.avif?t=1754675953\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/bfb621d3e907cf02c256ba01c3ae0b6d.webm?t=1754675953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/bfb621d3e907cf02c256ba01c3ae0b6d.mp4?t=1754675953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nylos is a <strong> puzzle </strong>platformer that takes players through diverse environments\u2013from lush caves to floating islands and high-tech labs.<br><br>The game introduces a <strong>variety</strong> <strong>of unique powers</strong> that you can <strong>combine</strong> in creative ways to solve puzzles and explore every corner of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/ba40a224f4653aa300793ad435c24a46.poster.avif?t=1754675953\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/ba40a224f4653aa300793ad435c24a46.webm?t=1754675953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/ba40a224f4653aa300793ad435c24a46.mp4?t=1754675953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nylos</strong>, a test subject in Dr. Solomon\u2019s AI lab, embarks on a journey to prove himself \u2014 joined by his quirky companion, <strong>Tiko</strong>, who helps, jokes, and keeps things lively as they uncover the lab\u2019s hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/6cc19caea76491533c1bea1b58984fd1.poster.avif?t=1754675953\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/6cc19caea76491533c1bea1b58984fd1.webm?t=1754675953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/6cc19caea76491533c1bea1b58984fd1.mp4?t=1754675953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level offers <strong>multiple ways to solve puzzles</strong>, encouraging players to experiment and find <strong>creative and personal paths</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/6b9e5e383b9f28c38e3c03b074c39b76.poster.avif?t=1754675953\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/6b9e5e383b9f28c38e3c03b074c39b76.webm?t=1754675953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/6b9e5e383b9f28c38e3c03b074c39b76.mp4?t=1754675953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
